5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know the monthly cost and who is out of pocket.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I need to know the actual hours involved. If we outsource, does that truly remove the time burden from my schedule?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I need to see where the usage and the labor actually sit. It feels uneven right now, and I want data before we commit to a year.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of guessing what state the rooms are in. I want a system where I know exactly what to expect when I walk in.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care most about keeping us on speaking terms. I want a system that prevents the silent resentment from building up again.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we hire help, the hours vanish, but the cost remains. I need to track that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, cost is a number, but time is a resource. I need to verify if outsourcing actually frees up my schedule or just shifts the burden to managing the service.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, time is only half the story. I need to see who is actually using the spaces versus who is doing the work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, usage data is great, but I need consistency. I want to stop bracing myself before opening the bathroom door.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, consistency is vital, but so is kindness. I want a system that stops us from snapping at each other over small things.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, usage data helps, but I need the receipts. Who is actually paying for the supplies right now?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, receipts are just paper. I need to know if the time spent cleaning is actually gone, or if I’m just managing a service instead.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, receipts show the leak, but I need the pattern. Who is actually using the space versus who is scrubbing it?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Toshio, receipts are fine, but I need the standard. I want to know exactly what ""done"" means so I stop guessing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, I hear you. But if we don’t address the underlying tension, the standard won’t matter. I want to know what breaks our harmony.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, harmony is good, but I need the numbers. I’ll check the receipts and the management rate sheet.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I’ll time a full pass and check the firm’s terms. I need to know if outsourcing actually removes the hours or just shifts the management burden.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, I’ll check the kitchen usage and the wall calendar. I need to see who is actually here versus who is doing the work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@Midori, I’ll check what “done” means to everyone and the grout situation. I need to know if the problem is the standard or the room itself.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@May, I’ll look into the house chat rows and the previous tenants’ note. I need to see what actually broke the last arrangement.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
